Package: accmv
Type: Package
Title: Inference with Available Complete-Case Missing Values
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Gang", "Cheng", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mathchenggang@gmail.com"),
    person("Yen-Chi", "Chen", role = "aut"),
    person("Maureen A.", "Smith", role = "aut"),
    person("Ying-Qi", "Zhao", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Implements inverse probability weighted, regression adjustment,
    and multiply robust estimators under the available complete-case missing
    value assumption of Cheng, Chen, Smith, and Zhao (2022)
    <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2207.02289>. Supports one or two primary variables,
    exponential-tilt sensitivity analysis, regression weights, and
    nonparametric bootstrap confidence intervals.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/mathcg/ACCMV,
    https://arxiv.org/abs/2207.02289
BugReports: https://github.com/mathcg/ACCMV/issues
